    "detailed_description": "<h1>formal edition</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><strong> The difference between &quot;ReMix:Encore&quot; and the official version<br>Characters: 3 heroes and 2 scenes in Encore, 7 heroes and more battle scenes in the official version<br>Difficulty: Encore can only challenge 2 difficulties. In the official version, each hero has 6 difficulties to challenge.<br>Music library: Encore\u2019s random music library contains 7 additional tracks, and the official version has 20+ additional tracks, and is continuously updated and added</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/3d9b1b9779ae3cab3291f4b0e75a8563.avif?t=1721486110\" width=620 height=276 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/07042317f343167626adc9a24f5e39e6.poster.avif?t=1721486110\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/07042317f343167626adc9a24f5e39e6.webm?t=1721486110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/07042317f343167626adc9a24f5e39e6.mp4?t=1721486110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A new hero - The Undertaker is here.<br>The Undertaker can assist in combat by summoning and controlling monsters' spirits.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/2a11fe7e8330b4b9d95f08d7ec64ca30.avif?t=1721486110\" width=620 height=153 /></span><br><strong>Continuously hitting the beat can accumulate legato levels, the music will become richer, and stronger performance of the character will be activated.<br>New mode - random music library mode<br>Turn on the random music library mode and use any hero to randomly play more than 20 new songs. Feel the different fighting rhythm!<br>Custom tracks<br>Players can import their favorite tracks into the game folder, switch to &quot;Custom Tracks&quot; mode in the game, and then play with customized music.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/c8503a9ac9345c6e48fc2a2e1937ed9d.avif?t=1721486110\" width=620 height=97 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/0d2504ae67252e0c46aaec0b85946696.poster.avif?t=1721486110\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/0d2504ae67252e0c46aaec0b85946696.webm?t=1721486110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/0d2504ae67252e0c46aaec0b85946696.mp4?t=1721486110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Different heroes, different rhythms.<br>Different heroes will bring different music and rhythms.\t\t<br>The effects of skills vary for different rhythms.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/209d8bc240bd6e2d6694d9079c4dd604.avif?t=1721486110\" width=620 height=97 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/72ae8746fa18c024c4c7c426c3b63785.poster.avif?t=1721486110\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097340/extras/72ae8746fa18c024c4c7c426c3b63785.webm?t=1721486110\" type=\"vide